(text "FRONT PANEL. 12x CTS 228EMVARGBFR IP67 RGB-backlit tactile switches. Switch -> TCA9555 @0x20 (internal pull-ups).\nBacklight: common anodes on BTN_LED_V (+5V via AO3401A high-side, gated by CM5 GPIO13 BTN_BL_PWM = global dimming, default off).\nCathodes R/G/B per button via 470R/470R/330R (~6mA, <=18mA/pin, ~96mA/expander worst case) to TCA9555 @0x21/@0x24/@0x25, active low. OFF = Hi-Z.\nTCA9555s on +3V3_SAFE; buzzer on main +3V3." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 15 12 0) (effects (font (size 1.6 1.6)) (justify left top)) (uuid "8cfc1b06-bf9e-433e-90ce-8c9c7c46e24b"))
)
